ulus menu button, for players who prefer to navigate while seated.\\nAdded sprint functionality, activated by pressing the trigger button on the non-compass hand, for greater movement control.", "created_date": 1792074644, "id": "27661394543536941", "version": "0.15.0", "version_code": 31, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24967959562880466", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27783878454621882"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "686602384478613"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed a UI issue from the previous release.", "created_date": 1791550114, "id": "27577130785296651", "version": "0.14.1", "version_code": 30, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24967959562880466", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27783878454621882"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "686602384478613"}]}, "change_log": "Added a compass with a rotating bezel to support more realistic navigation and bearing practice.\nAdded tree colliders to improve terrain interaction and environmental realism.\nImproved terrain structure and updated the in-app feedback flow.", "created_date": 1791488097, "id": "27567778446231885", "version": "0.14.0", "version_code": 29, "release_sta